{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n視后江美儀在TVB節目《璀璨之城》中飾演「丁麗明」一角，演出極為搶鏡，其標誌性的銀灰色短髮更令人印象深刻。原來這個造型背後，江美儀付出了巨大代價，不但每星期漂髮導致髮質嚴重受損，更要克服心理關口，飾演比自己年輕八年的吳卓羲的媽媽！\n</p>\n<h2>江美儀親解銀灰髮之謎 每週漂染頭髮斷晒</h2>\n<p>江美儀接受訪問時透露，為了呈現角色出場時的銀灰色短髮，她付出了沉重代價。她表示當時連續兩、三個月，每個星期都要漂一次頭髮，最終令頭髮無法承受，她坦言：「所以去到後期啲頭髮頂唔順斷晒。」除了髮型上的犧牲，為了配合角色瘋瘋癲癲的設定，美儀姐更刻意淡妝上陣，將自己最真實的一面呈現於鏡頭前：「雀斑、眼袋全部由得佢。」</p>\n<h2>江美儀接劇本感愕然 演吳卓羲媽媽有心理關口</h2>\n<p>在劇中，江美儀需要飾演吳卓羲的媽媽，但現實中她只比對方年長八年。對於這個安排，美儀姐坦言最初收到劇本時確實感到愕然。不過，專業的她很快便克服了心理障礙，她解釋：「但我睇完劇本後覺得呢個角色好有挑戰性，雖然有有心理關口，但作為一個演員有呢啲機會好難得，我就覺得不如試吓。」她最終決定接受挑戰，而其精湛演出亦證明了她的決定是正確的。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚專業：視后唔係浪得虛名！</h2>\n<p>江美儀為角色的付出曝光後，引來大批網民激讚其專業精神。不少人留言表示心痛：「原來個頭係真漂！太敬業了吧，好心痛！」、「難怪個角色咁入肉，原來背後付出咁多。」亦有網民佩服她敢於挑戰：「演吳卓羲阿媽真係要好大勇氣，但佢做得好好，完全冇違和感！」、「呢啲先係真正嘅演員，唔係靠靚樣。」、「支持美儀姐！視后級嘅付出！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_17316801606ae17b928038f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_17316801606ae17b928038f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_11090614266ae17bd02eb08.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_11090614266ae17bd02eb08.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_2576386276ae17bdc7cd9c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_2576386276ae17bdc7cd9c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_11438298476ae17be0dd873.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_11438298476ae17be0dd873.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_2298309996ae17be408e1c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_2298309996ae17be408e1c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_14217402646ae17be70da31.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_14217402646ae17be70da31.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/27_3568286ae17beae569a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/27_3568286ae17beae569a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_19808335176ae17bee511a4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_19808335176ae17bee511a4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_4927731356ae17bf1cca71.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_4927731356ae17bf1cca71.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_370261936ae17bf55a32d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_370261936ae17bf55a32d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_4327286046ae17bf8b871a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_4327286046ae17bf8b871a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_10947211346ae17bfd14a3c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_10947211346ae17bfd14a3c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:41:37.482834+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":997,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:30:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:46.751127+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T06:38:37.443975+00:00","content_hash":"7bb8dde6296b51413823da1d2f24d2c82da593c9a00f2a295d138dc8af30d384","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}